WEBVTT

00:01:27.097 --> 00:01:30.430
Well, for us, real things
are material things,

00:01:30.463 --> 00:01:33.830
things made of matter
that we can somehow see,

00:01:33.863 --> 00:01:38.163
like atoms, people, trees,
mountains, planets ...

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:40.063
By the same token,

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.530
invisible, immaterial things --
like gods and demons,

00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:46.930
heavens and hells --

00:01:48.097 --> 00:01:49.963
these are considered unreal.

00:01:50.397 --> 00:01:52.263
They're simply beliefs,

00:01:52.263 --> 00:01:56.030
subjective ideas that exist
only in the realm of the mind.

00:01:57.163 --> 00:01:58.297
To be real,

00:01:58.997 --> 00:02:02.030
a thing must exist objectively,